00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:29.420
But in consulting, you
have rather long hours.

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:32.450
So suddenly I didn't have all
this work in the evenings,

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:33.900
I had a bit more time.

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:35.040
And then I was sitting at home.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:38.370
I think my wife just left,
but I was talking to my wife.

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.360
Okay, what do I do with
all my evenings now, right?

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:42.060
What do I do with my time?

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:43.580
Of course, then the new position,

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.330
