00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:47.580
But surely it wasn't like
a nine to 12 or something.

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:49.030
So lots of time in the evening.

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:51.230
And I was already starting in this trap,

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:53.990
