that was the end game

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:00.490
to do that every day.

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:01.930
And then I talked to my wife,

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:04.250
what about starting a YouTube channel?

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:06.150
Wouldn't that be a great idea?

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.240
